"""Write the synthetic accepted-loans fixture.

The rows are invented. They use the Kaggle / LendingClub column names and
value formats (term like " 36 months", dates like "Dec-2018", zip like "941xx")
so the loader can be tested without the real extract. Do not replace this
file with a slice of the Kaggle download: loan-level LendingClub rows are not
committed.
"""

